{"term":"老司机","lang":"zh","script":"hans","romanization":"lǎo sījī","category":"internet_subculture","subcategory":"sexual experience archetype","concept":"sexual_innuendo_veteran","is_novel_concept":true,"register":"subculture","crude":20,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":88,"recognition_pct_peak":93,"peak_year":2016,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'old driver'; a person, usually male, celebrated as experienced in sexual matters and skilled at steering conversations or content into sexually explicit territory through innuendo.","english_term":null,"english_translation_quality":"none","notes":"Anchors an extended driving metaphor: 开车 (making innuendo), 车速太快 (content too explicit). Combines valorized experience with plausible-deniability euphemism. Peaked 2014–2016 on Weibo and WeChat. No English concept captures the specific compound of sexual expertise and innuendo skill held in esteem."}
