{"term":"露出博主","lang":"zh","script":"hans","romanization":"lùchū bókè","category":"sex_work_pornography","subcategory":"exhibitionist content creator","concept":"exhibitionism","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"subculture","crude":55,"technical":10,"recognition_pct_current":52,"recognition_pct_peak":58,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"An online content creator whose primary niche is exhibitionist content: nude or sexual self-exposure in semi-public or public settings, shared on social media or adult platforms.","english_term":"exhibitionist blogger","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"露出 is also the standard Chinese translation for the Japanese AV niche 露出 (public nudity fetish/outdoor exposure). The term blends Japanese kink vocabulary with Chinese social media influencer culture (博主 = blogger/KOL)."}
